{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e7775738-6aab-4ee7-b28b-c466aa0a37de",
    "name": "Diamond API",
    "description": "# Diamond API\n\nPostman collection generated from the current backend routes in this repo.\n\n## Configuration\n- `{{base_url}}`: for example `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api`\n- `{{access_token}}`: JWT bearer token, auto-saved after `Login` and `Refresh Token`\n- `{{user_id}}`: auto-saved after `Create User` and `Show User`\n\n## Seeded Accounts\n- `admin / password` -> `ADMIN`\n- `manager / password` -> `MANAGER`\n- `hr.staff / password` -> `HR_STAFF`\n- `warehouse.staff / password` -> `WAREHOUSE_STAFF`\n\n## Notes\n- `users/*` routes require `auth:api` and role `ADMIN`\n- `DELETE /users/delete/{id}` is a soft delete via `is_active = false`\n- Valid user roles: `ADMIN`, `MANAGER`, `HR_STAFF`, `WAREHOUSE_STAFF`\n- API responses follow `{ message, statusCode, metadata, path, timestamp }`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.metadata?.access_token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Login with `username` or `email`. This request does not use bearer auth. Default seeded example in body is `admin / password`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.metadata?.access_token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
            "description": "Refresh the current JWT token. Send the current bearer token with this request."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Get the authenticated user profile."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.unset('access_token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
            "description": "Logout the current account and clear the saved collection token on success."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "User management endpoints. All routes in this folder require an authenticated ADMIN account.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users",
            "description": "Get the full user list."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Show User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const userId = json?.metadata?.id;",
                  "if (userId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', String(userId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}",
            "description": "Get one user by numeric id."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const userId = json?.metadata?.id;",
                  "if (userId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', String(userId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"warehouse_01\",\n  \"email\": \"warehouse_01@diamond.local\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"role\": \"WAREHOUSE_STAFF\",\n  \"employee_id\": null,\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/create",
            "description": "Create a new user. `employee_id` is optional but must exist in `employees.id` and be unique if provided."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"warehouse_01_updated@diamond.local\",\n  \"role\": \"MANAGER\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/update/{{user_id}}",
            "description": "Partially update a user by id. `password` is optional on update."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/delete/{{user_id}}",
            "description": "Soft delete a user by setting `is_active` to `false`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "employee_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
